=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  config edit --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. Edit a setting: the keys$
# Configuration edits, numbered, each with its value. The keys$
# another screen saves, and dryRun, adminNoPassword and$
# sshConfigFile, are not here.$
$
# Edit a setting ###############################################$
$
   1) username             george$
   2) sshKeys              1 key$
   3) sshPort              2222$
   4) disableRootSSH       true$
   5) enableUfwSshPolicy   true$
   6) configureDns         true$
   7) syslogServers        None$
   8) ntpServers           None$
   9) kernel               false$
  10) confirmTimeout       3m$
  11) checkReleases        false$
  12) enableUnattendedUpgrades  true$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-12 or q]: $
$
$

